WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.643
Welcome to EstateAegis.

2
00:00:05.893 --> 00:00:07.256
In the next few minutes,

3
00:00:07.266 --> 00:00:10.631
we'll walk through a typical week for a home watch company,

4
00:00:10.641 --> 00:00:15.295
from the first visit of the day, to the storm that tests everyone's planning.

5
00:00:17.445 --> 00:00:20.287
Everything you'll see is demonstration data,

6
00:00:20.297 --> 00:00:23.724
in a sample company called Harborline Home Watch.

7
00:00:24.974 --> 00:00:27.775
Your team signs in at estateaegis.com.

8
00:00:27.785 --> 00:00:32.992
Owners, staff, families, and vendors each get a view made for them.

9
00:00:37.242 --> 00:00:40.196
After signing in, you land on the Overview.

10
00:00:41.446 --> 00:00:46.393
The first line tells you what needs you today: failed items, reports to sign,

11
00:00:46.403 --> 00:00:49.615
overdue visits, and new requests from clients.

12
00:00:50.865 --> 00:00:52.738
Needs your attention lists each one,

13
00:00:52.748 --> 00:00:55.300
with a button that takes you straight to it.

14
00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:58.657
Today's visits sit on the right.

15
00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:03.223
Plan today's route picks the homes that are due, lets you add others,

16
00:01:03.233 --> 00:01:05.865
and opens directions in Google Maps.

17
00:01:07.115 --> 00:01:11.823
The menu on the left is grouped the way you work: daily work, residences,

18
00:01:11.833 --> 00:01:12.986
team, and company.

19
00:01:12.996 --> 00:01:16.154
Each group folds away when you don't need it.

20
00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:23.850
Residences shows every home you look after, with its family and photo.

21
00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:29.052
Open one, and the Summary pulls together what needs attention,

22
00:01:29.062 --> 00:01:33.529
upcoming visits, open work, the next arrival, and the latest note.

23
00:01:34.779 --> 00:01:39.740
Home records keeps equipment, maintenance plans, documents, the house manual,

24
00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:42.389
and access codes with the right home.

25
00:01:43.639 --> 00:01:46.731
And People shows the family, the residence manager,

26
00:01:46.741 --> 00:01:49.180
and who on your team looks after it.

27
00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:53.762
Every visit follows a checklist.

28
00:01:53.772 --> 00:01:57.179
Start from a ready-made template, or build your own.

29
00:01:58.429 --> 00:02:02.211
Each item is answered Pass, Monitor, Fail, or N/A.

30
00:02:03.461 --> 00:02:06.645
You can require photos, mark items as required,

31
00:02:06.655 --> 00:02:10.574
and choose which failures alert the office right away.

32
00:02:13.624 --> 00:02:15.753
Now, let's head out on a visit.

33
00:02:15.763 --> 00:02:19.670
EstateAegis works on any phone, right in the browser.

34
00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.294
Checking in records the GPS location,

35
00:02:23.304 --> 00:02:27.421
so every report shows the visit really happened at the home.

36
00:02:29.271 --> 00:02:31.225
Then work through the checklist.

37
00:02:31.235 --> 00:02:33.879
Tap Fail, add a note, and take a photo.

38
00:02:36.029 --> 00:02:36.675
No signal?

39
00:02:36.685 --> 00:02:37.397
Keep going.

40
00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:40.152
Answers and photos are saved on the phone,

41
00:02:40.162 --> 00:02:43.758
and they sync on their own once you're back online.

42
00:02:51.008 --> 00:02:55.793
When a visit comes in with a failed item, the office is alerted right away,

43
00:02:55.803 --> 00:02:57.587
in the app and by email.

44
00:02:58.837 --> 00:03:02.719
Review the report, then publish it to the family with one click.

45
00:03:04.369 --> 00:03:08.898
The PDF carries your company's name and logo, with photos, notes,

46
00:03:08.908 --> 00:03:11.044
and the visit verification.

47
00:03:13.694 --> 00:03:16.139
Any finding can become a work order.

48
00:03:16.149 --> 00:03:20.777
The board groups jobs by due date, with quick filters, like overdue,

49
00:03:20.787 --> 00:03:22.469
or waiting on client.

50
00:03:23.719 --> 00:03:27.139
Assign a job to someone on your team, or to a vendor.

51
00:03:27.149 --> 00:03:31.995
When a repair needs the family's go-ahead, it waits for their approval.

52
00:03:33.745 --> 00:03:38.063
If they haven't answered yet, Remind client sends a friendly nudge.

53
00:03:38.073 --> 00:03:41.617
And Export CSV gives you the list for your records.

54
00:03:44.267 --> 00:03:49.563
Staff schedules shows the week for your whole team: shifts, visits, and jobs,

55
00:03:49.573 --> 00:03:50.995
person by person.

56
00:03:52.245 --> 00:03:55.212
Jobs that still need someone are listed below.

57
00:03:55.222 --> 00:03:57.931
Assign all hands them out in one step.

58
00:03:59.181 --> 00:04:01.245
And when severe weather is coming,

59
00:04:01.255 --> 00:04:04.372
Storm prep only narrows the week to storm work.

60
00:04:05.622 --> 00:04:10.404
The calendar lists every visit, arrival, job, and shift, day by day.

61
00:04:13.054 --> 00:04:17.386
When a storm is on the way, whether it's a hurricane, a winter storm,

62
00:04:17.396 --> 00:04:19.723
or a flood, open the storm board.

63
00:04:20.973 --> 00:04:24.580
Schedule pre-storm visits for every affected home at once,

64
00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.337
shared across your team.

65
00:04:28.187 --> 00:04:31.518
The board updates on its own as homes are secured.

66
00:04:31.528 --> 00:04:36.522
After the storm, it tracks each post-storm check, and any damage found.

67
00:04:37.772 --> 00:04:42.397
And each home gets an insurance-ready storm report, with the findings,

68
00:04:42.407 --> 00:04:44.974
the damage notes, and dated photos.

69
00:04:47.624 --> 00:04:52.550
Families sign in on your own branded page, with your logo and your welcome.

70
00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:57.347
Their home page shows each residence, the latest reports,

71
00:04:57.357 --> 00:04:59.417
and anything waiting on them.

72
00:05:00.667 --> 00:05:04.967
They can approve an estimate, send a request, or plan their next arrival,

73
00:05:04.977 --> 00:05:07.530
so the home is ready when they walk in.

74
00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:13.602
Vendors get a simple home of their own, with their jobs, due dates,

75
00:05:13.612 --> 00:05:16.901
and one tap to start work or submit completion.

76
00:05:19.551 --> 00:05:23.531
In Company settings, add your logo, your client portal welcome,

77
00:05:23.541 --> 00:05:25.945
and your visit verification rules.

78
00:05:27.195 --> 00:05:28.377
And in My profile,

79
00:05:28.387 --> 00:05:32.873
anyone can turn on two-factor sign-in with an authenticator app.

80
00:05:36.923 --> 00:05:38.217
And that's the tour.

81
00:05:38.227 --> 00:05:43.433
EstateAegis: your residences, your team, and your clients, all in one place.

82
00:05:45.283 --> 00:05:49.095
Start your free seven-day demo at estateaegis.com.

83
00:05:49.105 --> 00:05:51.190
No credit card required.

84
00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:57.069
And when you're ready, paid plans begin with a thirty-day free trial.

